# overlay-click (h2-input): the return-to-centre button clicked off default.
# Open on center=1.5,-2&scale=2, click the button (1359.5,780.5,36,36 from
# page.json's overlay_button box): the press starts and the release lands on
# it, so reset_view flushes both params to defaults — the URL empties and
# the camera returns to the default view. Behaviour: url line empty, camera
# line center [0,0] scale 0.5, shot at default.
query center=1.5,-2&scale=2
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
click 1377.5 798.5
wait 1000
shot overlay-click
